{"title":"Career Roadmap · Community Health Nurse","role":"Community Health Nurse","summary":"A Community Health Nurse (CHN) provides preventive, promotive, basic clinical, maternal-child, and public-health nursing services outside traditional hospital settings.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc Nursing","Course":"Nursing"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Community Health Nurse (CHN) provides preventive, promotive, basic clinical, maternal-child, and public-health nursing services outside traditional hospital settings."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical work environments include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Primary Health Centres (PHCs)"},{"text":"Community Health Centres"},{"text":"Government health programmes"},{"text":"Urban health centres"},{"text":"Schools and colleges"},{"text":"NGOs"},{"text":"Community clinics"},{"text":"Public-health projects"},{"text":"Home/community-care programmes"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["The role combines clinical nursing","public health","health education","disease prevention","community assessment","programme implementation."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For this pathway, the student should build strong competence in both bedside nursing and population-level health interventions."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Nursing fundamentals, anatomy, physiology and community-health foundation"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Clinical nursing, maternal-child health and community fieldwork"}],[{"text":"2030–2032"},{"text":"Public-health programmes, health education and community nursing"}],[{"text":"2032–2035"},{"text":"Community Health Nurse / Public Health Nursing roles"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior Community Health / Public Health Nursing responsibilities"}],[{"text":"2040+"},{"text":"Public Health Nursing leadershi